  "description": "🎄✨ Create endless holiday magic with this HUGE CHRISTMAS ORNAMENT BUNDLE SVG PACK — perfect for crafters, laser owners, and holiday sellers!\nThis premium collection includes a wide variety of layered ornaments: family name ornaments, gingerbread houses, snowmen, trucks, Christmas trees, customized family sets, round ornaments, hanging tags, and more.\nEach design is cleanly optimized for laser cutting and crafting. Perfect for Glowforge, xTool, OmTech, Cricut, Silhouette, and most CNC or laser machines.\nIdeal for Christmas craft fairs, personalized holiday gifts, seasonal décor shops, and high-volume holiday production.\n🎁 You Will Receive (Instant Download):\n✔️ 100+ Christmas ornament designs\n✔️ Multi-layer vector files for easy assembly\n✔️ Personalized family ornaments (up to multiple family members)\n✔️ Round ornaments, tree ornaments, house ornaments, gingerbread designs, trucks, gnomes & more\n✔️ Smooth, clean laser-friendly cutting paths\n✔️ Suitable for wood, MDF, acrylic, cardstock\n✔️ File formats: SVG, DXF, DWG, EPS, AI, PDF\n✔️ Fully compatible with Glowforge, xTool, OmTech, Cricut, Silhouette Cameo\n⭐ Perfect For:\n• Christmas craft fairs & holiday markets\n• Personalized family ornaments\n• Laser shop production & bulk gift orders\n• Holiday home décor & tree decorations\n• Small business Christmas inventory\n• Festive table & fireplace displays\n• Custom gift tags & keepsakes\n📦 Important:\nThis is a digital download only.\nNo physical product will be shipped.\nPlease check that your machine supports SVG/DXF/etc.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>🎄✨ Create endless holiday magic with this HUGE CHRISTMAS ORNAMENT BUNDLE SVG PACK — perfect for crafters, laser owners, and holiday sellers!<br>\nThis premium collection includes a wide variety of layered ornaments: family name ornaments, gingerbread houses, snowmen, trucks, Christmas trees, customized family sets, round ornaments, hanging tags, and more.</p>\n<p>Each design is cleanly optimized for laser cutting and crafting. Perfect for Glowforge, xTool, OmTech, Cricut, Silhouette, and most CNC or laser machines.<br>\nIdeal for Christmas craft fairs, personalized holiday gifts, seasonal décor shops, and high-volume holiday production.</p>\n<p>🎁 You Will Receive (Instant Download):</p>\n<p>✔️ 100+ Christmas ornament designs<br>\n✔️ Multi-layer vector files for easy assembly<br>\n✔️ Personalized family ornaments (up to multiple family members)<br>\n✔️ Round ornaments, tree ornaments, house ornaments, gingerbread designs, trucks, gnomes &amp; more<br>\n✔️ Smooth, clean laser-friendly cutting paths<br>\n✔️ Suitable for wood, MDF, acrylic, cardstock<br>\n✔️ File formats: SVG, DXF, DWG, EPS, AI, PDF<br>\n✔️ Fully compatible with Glowforge, xTool, OmTech, Cricut, Silhouette Cameo</p>\n<p>⭐ Perfect For:</p>\n<p>• Christmas craft fairs &amp; holiday markets<br>\n• Personalized family ornaments<br>\n• Laser shop production &amp; bulk gift orders<br>\n• Holiday home décor &amp; tree decorations<br>\n• Small business Christmas inventory<br>\n• Festive table &amp; fireplace displays<br>\n• Custom gift tags &amp; keepsakes</p>\n<p>📦 Important:</p>\n<p>This is a digital download only.<br>\nNo physical product will be shipped.<br>\nPlease check that your machine supports SVG/DXF/etc.</p>",
